      "content": "TL 10 NW                    REDBOURN             PUNCH BOWL LANE                                                  (south side)                                                  REDBOURN 9/235                                            Baker's Farmhouse II Farmhouse, now house.   C17 exposed timber frame.   Painted brick infill.  Plain tile steep pitched roof;  tile-hung E gable end. 1 storey and attics.   3 bays,  the door between the left and middle bay and set beneath a rebuilt ridge stack of 4 joined shafts.  3 glazing bar casements.  2 gabled timber frame dormers. Plank door in C18/19 tiled porch.   Lean-to additions either end, the left one earlier and with hipped roof. Listing NGR: TL1058509483"
    }
